## 480. 奇偶分类幻影

```lean
def parityCylinder (m : ℕ) : Set ℕ :=
  {k | k % (2 ^ m) = 2 ^ m - 1}

theorem parityCylinder_nonempty_nested :
    (∀ m, (parityCylinder m).Nonempty) ∧
    (∀ m, parityCylinder (m + 1) ⊆ parityCylinder m)

theorem parityCylinder_iInter_empty :
    ⋂ m, parityCylinder m = ∅
```

并在 \(\mathbb Z_2\) 中证明其极限点为 \(-1\)。

